163	   * against the recorded frame, and the whole page is applied to the `after_tick`
164	   * snapshot and compared with the recomputed snapshot at `next_tick`: a gap, a
165	   * hash mismatch or a delta page that fails to reduce to the snapshot is an
166	   * `integrity_failure`, never a partial response.
167	   */
168	  getDeltas(matchId, params) {
169	    const record = this.match(matchId);
170	    for (const name of params.keys()) {
